2  A FINDING OF MINE CORRECTED, AND THE MEASUREMENT THAT STANDS
   objects carrying no HANDLE in the bibliography   34   <- W-281's 34, and it stands
   objects naming no WORK in their own entry        12   <- what the sentence is about
   'Every object of this compendium names a work' is FALSE BY 12, not by 34.
   The number was right; the label on it was mine and it was wrong.

